2 CONT The national poet of Finland, who wrote in Swedish, and also exercised a great influence on Swedish literature. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Runeberg's poetry has been compared to that of the great European romantics, such as Hugo, Shelley, Keats, Lermontov and Petöfi. He was the first Finnish writer to achieve a broad national significance and a wide international fam
2 CONC e.
