1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Merchant
2 CONT
2 CONT http://gw.geneanet.org/strang?lang=sv;p=thomas+petterinpoika;n=peitzo
2 CONT
2 CONT Ralf Store's comments: Thomas Persson Peitzius is son of Pietari Mikonpoika/Per Michelsson Iso-Peitso who lived his life in Kälviä. Thomas is born in Kälviä, not in Kokkola/Gamlakarleby but has moved to Kokkola and has been mentio
2 CONC ned there in church- and tax books there 1678-1697 as Thomas Peitzo/Peitzius  together with his wife Brita Simonsdotter. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas' s father Pehr Mickelsson Peitso is mentioned in taxbooks in Kälviä up to 1667 (Pohjanmaa/Länsipohja/asiakirjat 1667 (CD994)).
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Persson Peitso is mentioned in taxbooks in Gamlakarleby/Kokkola town/stad/kaupunki 1680-1697: http://digi.narc.fi/digi/view.ka?kuid=12761965 (1680) http://digi.narc.fi/digi/view.ka?kuid=12769986 (1697)
