1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mekanikus vid Amiraliteten, adlad.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jonas_Lidstr%C3%B6mer
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.nad.riksarkivet.se/sbl/Presentation.aspx?id=11355
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://sok.riksarkivet.se/sbl/Presentation.aspx?id=11355
2 CONT
2 CONT -
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jonas_Lidstr%C3%B6mer
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lidstr%C3%B6mer
2 CONT
2 CONT -
